# XIRR: internal rate of return for a dated (non-periodic) cash-flow schedule.
# Same schedule as XNPV; the annualized return is ~37.34%.
INPUT A1 -10000
INPUT A2 2750
INPUT A3 4250
INPUT A4 3250
INPUT A5 2750
INPUT B1 39448
INPUT B2 39508
INPUT B3 39751
INPUT B4 39859
INPUT B5 39904
INPUT C1 =XIRR(A1:A5, B1:B5)
CHECKNUM C1 0.373363

# All-positive flows have no return -> #NUM!
INPUT C2 =XIRR(A2:A5, B2:B5)
CHECKERR C2 #NUM!
